Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.04,0:00:03.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.80,0:00:06.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝正打破66个封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith is tring to break the 66 seals 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.43,0:00:07.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以使路西法能逃出地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}To free lusifer from hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.71,0:00:10.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而路西法会让天启现世\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lusifer will bring the apocalypse
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.19,0:00:11.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-妈  -萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom.  - Sam
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.84,0:00:13.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-对不起  -为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry  - For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.72,0:00:15.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就因为我体内有恶魔的血吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this mean I have demon blood in me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.58,0:00:17.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想再当学校里的怪人了  哪怕就一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna be the freak for once Dean
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.47,0:00:19.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想做个正常人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna be normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.02,0:00:22.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你弟弟走上一条不归路\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brother is heading down a dangerous road, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.89,0:00:25.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道你已经做得有多离谱了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you even know how far of the reservation you've gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.77,0:00:27.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,背离常人  背离人类多远了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How for from normal, from human?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.87,0:00:28.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我不认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I didn't know you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.97,0:00:30.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会猎杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would hunter you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.27,0:00:32.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是想问我是否知道恶魔之血的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I know about the demon blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.45,0:00:33.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没告诉迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did't tell Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.72,0:00:35.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的你到底在哪里  露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell are you, Ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.18,0:00:37.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喝完了  打给我  我还要更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all out. call me. I need more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.80,0:00:42.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这都是为了你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is for your own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.07,0:00:44.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥们儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.57,0:00:47.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  哥们儿  这一点也不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey -- guys, this isn't funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.97,0:00:48.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.99,0:00:51.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.09,0:01:10.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  让我出去  这一点也不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Let me out. This is not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.76,0:01:12.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你TM说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.10,0:01:14.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  搞什么  这太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. Come on, this is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.77,0:01:17.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  直到你能戒掉恶魔血\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not until you dry out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.20,0:01:22.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我不该对你说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry. I shouldn't have lied to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.97,0:01:24.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你...打开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.58,0:01:28.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不必道歉  这不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to apologize. It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.38,0:01:31.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一次又一次的说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your fault that you lied to me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.01,0:01:33.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.08,0:01:34.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在明白了  你是无法自控\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it now. You couldn't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.99,0:01:36.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不是什么瘾君子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not some junkie!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.15,0:01:37.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.19,0:01:38.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我刚刚想起你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I've just imagined
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.35,0:01:40.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近那些疯狂的举动\N{\fnArial\fs30}how strung out you've been lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.59,0:01:43.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上你把这当作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're actually trying to twist this
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.03,0:01:46.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一场滑稽的戒毒行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}into some kind of ridiculous drug intervention?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.10,0:01:47.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死鸭子嘴还硬\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it smells like a duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.70,0:01:50.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我不是因为上瘾而喝恶魔血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I'm not drinking the demon blood for kicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.00,0:01:53.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正变得强大到可以杀死莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting strong enough to kill lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.37,0:01:54.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-强大?  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Strong? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.50,0:01:56.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔血不会让你变强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about as far away from strong
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.07,0:01:57.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只会让你变得\N{\fnArial\fs30}as you can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.24,0:02:00.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虚弱  绝望  可悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try weak. Try desperate. Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.21,0:02:04.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能杀死莉莉丝才是关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing Lilith is what matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.41,0:02:07.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者你太过于自以为是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or are you so busy being self-righteous
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:09.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而忘了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You forgot about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.22,0:02:13.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝一定会要死的  我和鲍比一定会杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Lilith's gonna die. Bobby and I will kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.22,0:02:15.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是和你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.53,0:02:17.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你不是认真的吧  -恭喜你答对了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're not serious. - Congrats, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.53,0:02:20.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在对抗天启时  你绝对会坐冷板凳的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just bought yourself a benchwarmer seat to the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.76,0:02:23.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  不 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.40,0:02:25.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.40,0:02:29.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean! Let me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.31,0:02:34.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean! Let me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.51,0:02:40.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我出去  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out! Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.80,0:03:39.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥们儿  快下来  有东西来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys! Get down here! Something's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.94,0:03:42.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.68,0:03:47.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真高兴再次见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a pleasure to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.28,0:03:50.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,貌似你落到我手里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And looks like I have you all to myself here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.62,0:03:52.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.02,0:03:56.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要如何度过这段时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will we pass the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.80,0:04:06.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.30,0:04:09.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不要  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, don't. Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.14,0:04:10.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.31,0:04:18.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要啊  住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.38,0:04:19.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿拉斯泰尔...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alastair...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.88,0:04:23.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.05,0:04:24.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.89,0:04:27.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出人意料的礼貌啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So polite all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.56,0:04:31.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:36.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你的配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.00,0:04:42.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  阿拉斯泰尔  不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Alastair. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.94,0:04:48.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.28,0:04:53.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.28,0:04:56.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了  求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.09,0:05:05.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! no! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.93,0:05:08.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还要持续多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long is this gonna go on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.90,0:05:13.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们来看看恶魔戒毒手册\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, let me look it up in my demon-detox manual.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.60,0:05:16.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦  等一下  没人写过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wait. No one ever wrote one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.78,0:05:22.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以没人知道要持续多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}No telling how long it'll take.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.15,0:05:25.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是萨姆能不能挺过这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, or if Sam will even live through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.19,0:05:34.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.36,0:05:35.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧  卢夫斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suck dirt and die, Rufus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.99,0:05:38.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你再打我电话  我会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call me again, I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.03,0:05:41.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卢夫斯怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up with Rufus?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.50,0:05:43.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.17,0:05:52.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很忙  你这混蛋  没事别烦我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm busy, you son of bitch. This better be important.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.26,0:06:17.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,答案是"是"  那是幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer's "YES." You're hallucinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.80,0:06:20.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了  就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.50,0:06:23.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者说  就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, I mean, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.68,0:06:27.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm losing my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.51,0:06:29.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.85,0:06:32.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.85,0:06:34.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}An explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.68,0:06:36.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么能这么对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you do this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.62,0:06:39.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本以为我们会变得正常的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we were gonna be normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.56,0:06:42.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我试过了  真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried. I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.66,0:06:45.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果没成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't pan out that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.00,0:06:47.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.53,0:06:49.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sorry, kid"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.00,0:06:54.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你想说的  这是我们一直想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you have to say? It's all we ever wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.54,0:06:56.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们差点就成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.04,0:06:58.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你离开了老爸  你放弃捕猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you got away from dad. You quit hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.88,0:07:00.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你曾将要成为一名律师然后结婚生子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were gonna become a lawyer and get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.88,0:07:03.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你为什么把事情搞砸了?  -听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why did you blow it?! - Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.35,0:07:05.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们杀了杰西卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}They killed jessica.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.85,0:07:07.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.02,0:07:08.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你没和迪恩离开的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you hadn't run off with Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.82,0:07:10.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你留下保护她的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'd been there to protect her,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.55,0:07:13.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她就会活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'd still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.09,0:07:14.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.92,0:07:16.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为杰西卡希望你变成这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think Jess would want you to turn into this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.49,0:07:18.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She loved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.69,0:07:20.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得把她作为借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think she would be happy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.40,0:07:22.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会高兴么\N{\fnArial\fs30}you using her as an excuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.16,0:07:25.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉  真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.33,0:07:27.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人生不会按照你的想法去发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}But life doesn't turn out the way you thought it would
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.84,0:07:30.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当你14岁的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you were 14 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.04,0:07:31.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就于众不同了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were never gonna be normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.67,0:07:33.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们永远逃避不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were never gonna get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.84,0:07:35.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成熟点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.51,0:07:40.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.35,0:07:44.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许根本没有...解决之道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe there's... no escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.19,0:07:46.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终究...\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.49,0:07:49.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么可能摆脱你的本性\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you run from what's inside you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.46,0:07:55.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消息  不好的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}The news. And the news ain't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.63,0:07:58.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是卢夫斯打电话来的原因吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what Rufus called about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.57,0:08:01.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基韦斯特有十个物种灭绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Key west sees 10 species go extinct"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.22,0:08:02.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.39,0:08:04.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另外  阿拉斯加  15人捕鱼小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, Alaska -- 15-man fishing crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.96,0:08:07.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,集体失明...原因不详\N{\fnArial\fs30}All stricken blind -- cause unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.49,0:08:08.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纽约...\N{\fnArial\fs30}New york --
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.63,0:08:10.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老师持枪  反锁大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teacher goes postal, locks the door,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.56,0:08:11.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恰好杀死了66个小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kills exactly 66 kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.73,0:08:14.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些都是在一天之内完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this in a single day?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.90,0:08:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我查过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I looked them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.50,0:08:19.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毫无疑问的  这些都是封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no doubt about it. they're all Seals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.17,0:08:21.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迅速地破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breaking -- fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.57,0:08:24.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还剩多少封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many are left?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.07,0:08:26.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁知道呢  不会很多的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows? Can't be many.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.34,0:08:29.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的天使伙伴在什么鬼地方啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell are your angel pals?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.18,0:08:31.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去问谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.38,0:08:37.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just wondering...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.19,0:08:39.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.36,0:08:43.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天启越来越近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the apocalypse being nigh and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.23,0:08:45.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们有时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is now really the right time to be
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.80,0:08:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去弄这种家庭剧么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having this little domestic drama of ours?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.60,0:08:48.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这话是什么意思啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.86,0:08:52.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不喜欢这样做  但...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't like this any more than you do, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.57,0:08:54.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆能杀死恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam can kill demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.44,0:08:56.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他能阻止世界末日的来临\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got a shot at stopping armageddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.77,0:09:00.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢  牺牲萨姆的生命  灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, sacrifice Sam's life, his soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.61,0:09:01.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了更美好的事业吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the greater good?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.71,0:09:03.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你想说的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.21,0:09:06.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时光流逝  就让我们把萨姆当做原子弹使用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Times are bad, so let's use Sam as a nuclear warhead?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.48,0:09:09.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你讨厌我做这样的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know you hate me for suggesting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.92,0:09:12.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不喜欢这个建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate me for suggesting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.89,0:09:14.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把他当做我的儿子一样爱着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love that boy like a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.59,0:09:17.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想说的是  他现在在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I'm saying is, maybe he's here right now
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.99,0:09:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而不是在战场上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead of on the battlefield,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.50,0:09:23.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们十分爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause we love him too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.90,0:10:00.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可怜的宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.57,0:10:04.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.07,0:10:05.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.21,0:10:10.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来糟糕透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look just awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.32,0:10:17.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.79,0:10:19.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.59,0:10:21.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.73,0:10:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.90,0:10:29.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从不会认为我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never thought I'd...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.47,0:10:31.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用这种方式证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}...turn out this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.30,0:10:33.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.64,0:10:36.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有价值的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pisspoor excuse for a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.47,0:10:41.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你心都碎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your heart is broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.41,0:10:45.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说的对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I close?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.35,0:10:48.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.52,0:10:50.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在做着正确的事  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing the right thing, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.92,0:10:55.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你所做的事非常勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you're doing is brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.86,0:10:59.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是疯了  而是很务实的做法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not being crazy. you're being practical.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.66,0:11:05.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  我为你感到骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I am so proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.60,0:11:10.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.44,0:11:12.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  迪恩他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.41,0:11:15.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你哥哥不理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother doesn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.41,0:11:21.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从小就被培养成一个猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was raised a hunter, from a long line.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.58,0:11:25.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们清楚这会是个艰难的抉择\N{\fnArial\fs30}We understand that there are gonna be hard choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.25,0:11:29.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不惜一切代价完成任务 \N{\fnArial\fs30}And we do what we have to to get the job done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.03,0:11:33.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的家族是被诅咒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, our family is cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.53,0:11:37.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.57,0:11:40.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能把这诅咒转化成天赋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the power to turn it into a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.20,0:11:44.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能用这个来对抗他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can use it against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.14,0:11:45.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了报仇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}For revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.94,0:11:48.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  是为了正义\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, for justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.48,0:11:53.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你有多害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how scared you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.42,0:11:59.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.09,0:12:02.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我身体里的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}In me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.76,0:12:04.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.59,0:12:06.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是罪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's... evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.46,0:12:09.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也是知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.23,0:12:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果它比我还强大呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if it's stronger than me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.00,0:12:18.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我呀  如果迪恩是对的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me. what if Dean's right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.34,0:12:24.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩永远不会知道你有多么强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean can never know how strong you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.18,0:12:27.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为迪恩很弱小\N{\fnArial\fs30}...because Dean is weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.12,0:12:31.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看他对你所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at what he's done to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.62,0:12:35.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你锁在这里  他吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locking you in here? He's terrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.26,0:12:37.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他冲昏头脑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in over his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.79,0:12:41.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该离开他自己走下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to go on without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.93,0:12:44.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须这样去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.84,0:12:47.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须去杀死莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to kill Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.37,0:12:51.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使它杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if it kills me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.44,0:12:57.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我的死有点意义吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make my death mean something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.35,0:13:00.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我指望着你  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm counting on you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.22,0:13:02.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别让任何人任何事阻碍了你的道路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let anyone or anything get in your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.95,0:13:06.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩也不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.73,0:13:45.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.23,0:13:47.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里喊了2个半小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been screaming myself hoarse out here
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.16,0:13:48.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗓子都喊哑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For about 2 1/2 hours now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.60,0:13:49.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.93,0:13:51.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以从解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you can start
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.10,0:13:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在伊利诺伊发生的事开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}With what the hell happened in Illinois.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.00,0:13:54.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.84,0:13:56.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说废话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut the crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.17,0:13:58.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须告诉我些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were gonna tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.17,0:13:59.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么值得说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, nothing of import.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.94,0:14:03.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在天堂被菊爆了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got ass-reamed in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.35,0:14:04.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么叫"没什么值得说的"  -迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But it was not "of import"?  - Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.85,0:14:07.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.22,0:14:10.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.72,0:14:14.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我你究竟为什么召唤我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to the reason you really called me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.89,0:14:17.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是关于萨姆的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about Sam, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.03,0:14:21.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他能做到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can he do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.36,0:14:24.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能杀了莉莉丝  阻止天启的到来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill lilith, stop the apocalypse?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.70,0:14:26.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possibly, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.94,0:14:29.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但正如你所知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.44,0:14:32.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他必须付出些代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd have to take certain steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.57,0:14:35.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把恶魔血当毒品吸么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crank up the hell-blood regimen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.38,0:14:38.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当他强大能杀死莉莉丝时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consuming the amount of blood it would take to kill lilith
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.81,0:14:40.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔血会永久性地改变你的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would change your brother forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:44.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最有可能的是  他会成为下一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most likely, he would become the next creature
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.32,0:14:46.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须杀掉的生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you would feel compelled to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.26,0:14:53.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事不会会就这样过去的  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no reason this would have to come to pass, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.26,0:14:55.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们相信的是你  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We believe it's you, Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.93,0:14:57.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是你的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.57,0:15:01.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唯一困扰我们的事情是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only question for us is
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.24,0:15:04.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是否会接受这样的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether you're willing to accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.37,0:15:08.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站起来接受你的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand up and accept your role.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.38,0:15:11.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是那个能阻止这一切的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the one who will stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.12,0:15:22.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我做了  萨姆就不用做了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I do this... Sammy doesn't have to?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.86,0:15:27.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从好的那一面讲  是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it gives you comfort to see it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.97,0:15:32.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  你这几天太人渣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, you're a dick these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.64,0:15:44.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我入伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.48,0:15:47.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打算全心全意地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give yourself over wholly
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.18,0:15:50.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,服务上帝和他的天使吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the service of god and his angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.45,0:15:52.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.45,0:15:54.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重复一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.86,0:16:05.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我将全心全意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give myself over wholly
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.37,0:16:07.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,侍奉上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}To serve god...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.14,0:16:09.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.87,0:16:12.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你发誓会听从他的意愿和指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}You swear to follow his will and his word
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.21,0:16:13.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迅速地  顺从地\N{\fnArial\fs30}As swiftly and obediently
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.64,0:16:15.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像听从你的父亲一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you did your own father's?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.98,0:16:21.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.75,0:16:25.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.59,0:16:28.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耐心等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.42,0:16:31.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候我们会来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we call on you when it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.08,0:17:15.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来人啊  救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys! help!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.22,0:17:22.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命啊  放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! let me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.39,0:17:24.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.88,0:17:30.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我说错了  你可以指正\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, correct me if I'm wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.78,0:17:34.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你竟然愿意成为天使的贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you willingly signed up to be the angels' bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.88,0:17:38.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  "屁精"是不是好点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. you prefer "sucker"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.45,0:17:41.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说了那么多他们的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything you said about them,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.19,0:17:42.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在又相信他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you trust them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.49,0:17:44.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样  鲍比  相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, give me a little credit, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.39,0:17:47.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从来没相信过他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never trusted them less.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.09,0:17:50.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉他们像是从火神星来的黑暗政客\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, they come on like shady politicians from planet vulcan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.50,0:17:51.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那为什么你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then why in the hell --
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.87,0:17:53.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有选择的余地吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because what other option do I have?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.73,0:17:57.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是选择相信天使  还是让萨姆相信恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's either trust the angels, or let Sammy trust a demon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.84,0:18:01.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see your point.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.31,0:18:07.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.95,0:18:12.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像安静的有点奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a little too much nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.90,0:18:28.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会不会在装\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if he's faking?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.10,0:18:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的认为他会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think he would?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.14,0:18:32.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为他什么都做得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he'd do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.94,0:18:36.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不是在装\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ain't faking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.30,0:18:59.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了他的安全  不得不把他绑起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have to tie him down for his own safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.83,0:19:03.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你在听吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean? you with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.94,0:19:08.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  趁他还没再次发作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean! before he has another fit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.31,0:19:10.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  赶快把事情办妥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah! let's just get it over with!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.53,0:19:28.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不得不这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.53,0:19:32.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔的血把你在房间里乱扔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon blood was flinging you all over the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.03,0:19:33.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me something, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.47,0:19:35.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么这么作践自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you do this to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.47,0:19:40.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.17,0:19:42.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.54,0:19:44.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀死莉莉丝  是个重要的借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Kill Lilith." the big excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.41,0:19:47.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.25,0:19:49.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了报仇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.58,0:19:51.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.85,0:19:52.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.89,0:19:54.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,报仇的原因呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revenge for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.05,0:19:55.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为她送我进地狱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}For sending me to hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.82,0:19:57.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有看到  我回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you happen to notice I'm back?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.42,0:19:59.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活生生得回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alive and kicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.93,0:20:02.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-到底是为什么  -为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So what's the point? - The point?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.10,0:20:08.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阻止该死的天启  怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about stop the damn apocalypse?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.37,0:20:10.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我的任务  不是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My gig! not yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.47,0:20:12.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使说的  记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels said so, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.27,0:20:16.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝选择了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}God picked me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.91,0:20:20.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还有没有好一点的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, have you got any other fantastic excuses?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.52,0:20:30.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再问你一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna ask one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.52,0:20:33.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们确信现在做的事情是对的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we absolutely sure we're doing the right thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.96,0:20:36.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  你也看到了他的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, you saw what was happening to him down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.87,0:20:39.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔的血在害他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon blood is killing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.04,0:20:41.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  是我们在害他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it isn't. We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.84,0:20:43.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  -对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.64,0:20:45.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看不下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't bite my tongue any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.61,0:20:46.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们正在害他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're killing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.94,0:20:48.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他关在下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeping him locked up down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.48,0:20:50.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种直截了当的方法不起作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}This "cold turkey" thing isn't working.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.61,0:20:53.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他得不到他所需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If,if he doesn't get what he needs...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.65,0:20:55.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.45,0:20:57.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆撑不了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's not gonna last much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.39,0:21:03.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.00,0:21:07.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会给他恶魔的血  绝对不给\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not giving him demon blood. I won't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.40,0:21:08.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他死了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he dies?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.83,0:21:12.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少他死的时候还是个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then at least he dies human!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.20,0:21:16.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  我知道你喝血的真正原因了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know why you really drink that blood, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.71,0:21:20.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别管我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.71,0:21:24.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你感觉更强大  天下无敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes you feel strong. invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.05,0:21:27.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成为3只小猪里的大灰狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A big bad wolf in a world of little pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.32,0:21:29.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. you're wrong, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.82,0:21:32.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不止这个吧  是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more than that, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.56,0:21:36.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你整个人生都感觉不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's because your whole life, you felt different.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.43,0:21:38.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说得对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.23,0:21:40.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.23,0:21:42.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I hit a little close to home, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.30,0:21:47.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和其他孤独的孩子一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not different because you were some...lonely kid
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.87,0:21:51.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-还是因为你的畸形家庭  -别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or because of your weirdo family. - Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.78,0:21:58.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-因为你是个怪物  -闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Because you're a monster. - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.42,0:22:03.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-闭嘴  -你一直是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just shut the hell up! - You were always a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.95,0:22:06.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有当你吃下更多的毒药\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you only feel right
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.42,0:22:10.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和邪恶的时候你才会感到舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're sucking down more poison and more evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.06,0:22:14.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以马上替他死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would die for him in a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.00,0:22:19.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我不会让他作践自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I won't let him do this to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.50,0:22:20.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.57,0:22:25.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想这就是我的底线了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I found my line.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.08,0:22:29.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让自己的弟弟变成怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't let my brother turn into a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.91,0:22:32.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  你是一个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monster, Sam. You're a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.62,0:22:34.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.02,0:22:36.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想尽办法装作我们是兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried so hard to pretend that we were brothers,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.84,0:22:40.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是我们要猎杀的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you weren't one of the filthy things that we hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.71,0:22:43.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们不是同一个物种\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're not even the same species.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.55,0:22:46.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-对我来说  你什么都不是  -别这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're nothing to me. - Don't say that to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.92,0:22:49.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不许你对我这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you say that to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.05,0:23:48.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.54,0:24:11.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.21,0:25:23.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.44,0:25:25.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜  你不该来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't have come, Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.21,0:25:27.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要放走萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you let out Sam Winchester?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.95,0:25:30.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those were my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.45,0:25:31.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.55,0:25:35.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西  你看到他的样子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass...you saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.69,0:25:37.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在喝恶魔的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's drinking demon blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.89,0:25:40.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这比我们想象的更糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so much worse than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.73,0:25:43.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩试图阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean was trying to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.13,0:25:47.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的不该来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really shouldn't have come.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.84,0:26:29.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unh-unh, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.51,0:26:33.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你唯一能做的是跟我回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only place you're going is back inside with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.42,0:26:39.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.69,0:26:42.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈的  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.92,0:26:46.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会开枪的  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't shoot me, bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.76,0:26:50.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别考验我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't test me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.16,0:26:53.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.24,0:27:03.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.15,0:27:12.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是想要帮你啊  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're trying to help you, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.93,0:27:23.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就开枪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.04,0:28:10.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是怎么逃出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How in the hell did he get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.20,0:28:13.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能有帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he had help.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.61,0:28:15.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这间房子到处都是打破的魔鬼封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Room full of busted devil's traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.71,0:28:17.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.48,0:28:18.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.55,0:28:20.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that'd be my guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.62,0:28:23.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她怎么可能碰这扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did she even touch the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.79,0:28:25.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得她用了巫术吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think she's got the mojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.35,0:28:27.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.34,0:28:34.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也搞不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.47,0:28:35.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是怎么逃出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what difference does it make?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.14,0:28:36.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}How he got gone
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.37,0:28:38.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最重要的是  他要去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't as important as where he got gone to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.07,0:28:39.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I'll tell you one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.57,0:28:41.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  我希望那个家伙是露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}At this point, I hope he's with ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.08,0:28:42.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.68,0:28:44.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为她是我下一个要铲除的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause killing her's the next big item on my to-do list.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.41,0:28:47.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为你只给天使做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were on call for angel duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.35,0:28:48.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我随时待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am on call --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.48,0:28:50.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在车上  在我去杀了那婊子的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my car, on my way to murder the bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.42,0:28:53.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-还有一件事  -什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}One thing. what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.05,0:28:55.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆不想被找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam don't want to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.22,0:28:59.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说明他会很难找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means he's gonna be damn near impossible to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.73,0:29:03.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了  等着瞧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.42,0:29:32.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蜜月套房  不会吧  真是受宠若惊啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honeymoon suite. really, I'm flattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.66,0:29:36.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把我从那房子里放出来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you bust me out of that room?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.00,0:29:37.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么有这能耐啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could i, sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.30,0:29:40.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那整个房间本身就是用来困我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole thing's engineered to bite me in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.53,0:29:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我是怎么出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how did I get out of there?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.50,0:29:44.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  也不想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I don't want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.89,0:29:48.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你出来了  这才是最重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're out. that's all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.59,0:29:49.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴看到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.79,0:29:52.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗  那你他妈去哪儿啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? where the hell have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.59,0:29:54.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经尽快赶过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got here as quick as I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.02,0:29:56.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说这三个星期  我一直打你电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean the past three weeks! I've been calling you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.13,0:29:57.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在忙着把莉莉丝找出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been pretty deep in it, trying to dig out lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.89,0:30:00.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候我没空查我的语音信箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I can't sit around and check my voicemail.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.20,0:30:04.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  让你受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry you're hurting.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.84,0:30:07.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.17,0:30:10.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道迪恩会对你做出这种事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no idea that dean would do that to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.98,0:30:14.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me both.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.51,0:30:19.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你订这房间不会只是想打动我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't book this joint just to impress me, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.95,0:30:21.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩会找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's gonna come after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.89,0:30:24.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他知道我的习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he knows my habits,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.46,0:30:27.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的别名  一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}My aliases, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.76,0:30:29.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他清楚我会住哪家旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows exactly which motel I'd pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.99,0:30:32.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hence the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.36,0:30:35.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要用尽方法将他甩掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it takes to shake him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.13,0:30:37.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不件容易的事  我是说...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it won't be easy. I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.70,0:30:39.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他比任何人都要了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows you better than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.57,0:30:42.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没他想的那么了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not as well as he thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.24,0:30:45.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  真可悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.48,0:30:48.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.98,0:30:52.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你们俩兄弟反目成仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}That things have gotten this bad between you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.29,0:31:37.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警察找到了我的车子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police found my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.13,0:31:40.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被丢在了北达科他州詹姆斯敦的巷子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abandoned in an alley in jamestown, north dakota.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.93,0:31:42.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说  他换车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's switching up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.43,0:31:44.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在詹姆斯敦有没有什么车被偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any other cars stolen in jamestown?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.70,0:31:45.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两辆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.84,0:31:47.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1999的本田汽车\N{\fnArial\fs30}1999 honda civic --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.04,0:31:49.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蓝色  很好而且是匿名的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blue -- nice and anonymous,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.27,0:31:50.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是萨姆喜欢的款\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like sam likes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.44,0:31:51.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另一辆呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was the other one?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.84,0:31:55.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白色的05凯迪拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}White '05 escalade with custom rims.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.55,0:31:56.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,围着霓虹灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a neon sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.75,0:31:59.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说对了  他不可能要那辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. he'd never take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.12,0:32:01.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这正是他会偷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is exactly what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.18,0:32:03.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.05,0:32:05.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我了解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.72,0:32:07.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们就去那个方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'll head in that direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.96,0:32:11.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你留在这里  继续搜索警方数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay here, ride the police databases.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.90,0:32:14.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得尽快找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to find him quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.63,0:32:19.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的胃口越来越大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your appetite's gotten much bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.04,0:32:23.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这意味这什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.97,0:32:27.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  没事的  是件好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, relax. it's okay. it's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.64,0:32:30.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是说明你越来越强大了  仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just means you're getting stronger. that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.15,0:32:32.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意味着你已经足以铲除莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means you're strong enough to kill lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.82,0:32:34.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间也刚刚好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just in time, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.35,0:32:35.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为最后的封印正在打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the final seals are breaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.89,0:32:38.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有多少个\N{\fnArial\fs30}how many are left?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.56,0:32:40.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-三个  两个  -什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three? two? what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.89,0:32:42.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那天使都到哪儿去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, where are the angles?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.06,0:32:43.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遛狗吧  管他们去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screwing the pooch, wherever they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.59,0:32:44.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重要的是  现在我们是一步步\N{\fnArial\fs30}The point is, it's looking more and more
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.90,0:32:47.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接近最后的封印了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like we're getting down to the final seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.70,0:32:51.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我发现一个天大的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I found out something big.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.13,0:32:52.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.24,0:32:54.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第六十六个封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seal 66?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.00,0:32:57.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是任何一个恶魔都能打破的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be broken by just any demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.01,0:32:59.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  只有路西法的第一大徒弟才能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, only Lucifer's first can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.71,0:33:01.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"路西法的第一大徒弟"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Lucifer's first"?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.54,0:33:04.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔的主日学校故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demon sunday-school story.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.58,0:33:07.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起天使来  上帝更宠爱世人\N{\fnArial\fs30}God prefers humans to angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.88,0:33:10.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路西法嫉妒了  然后他想出一个办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer gets jealous. and then he gets creative.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.79,0:33:13.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他扭曲人类的灵魂并且教唆他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he twists and tempts a human soul
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.12,0:33:17.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成为第一个恶魔   就像是对上帝的公然挑衅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Into the very first demon -- as a "screw you" to god.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.13,0:33:20.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是他被关起来的首要原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what got him locked up in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.76,0:33:23.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个是莉莉丝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was lilith?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.80,0:33:26.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她比看上去要老多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's way older than she looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.10,0:33:30.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  这么说...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.44,0:33:33.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果莉莉丝是唯一能打破最后一道封印的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}If lilith is the only one who can break the final seal,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.58,0:33:35.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我能及时抓到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I get to her in time...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.31,0:33:38.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么路西法就不可能逃出那笼子 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then Lucifer never busts out of his cage -- exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.12,0:33:40.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  你知道她在哪儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. you figure out where she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.82,0:33:42.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那婊子能躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That bitch can hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.25,0:33:43.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我还是找到了线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I finally have a lead
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.99,0:33:46.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从一个或许能帮助我们的人身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}On someone who might be able to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.69,0:33:49.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我瞄上了莉莉丝的随从\N{\fnArial\fs30}I closed in on a member of lilith's entourage.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.66,0:33:54.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们可以称呼她作...私人厨师\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might call her a... personal chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.23,0:33:56.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,厨师？  不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chef? seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.23,0:33:58.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她吃什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does she eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.90,0:34:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会想知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.84,0:34:06.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说发生在圣保罗的骇闻了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear about that horrible thing at St. Paul's?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.34,0:34:07.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.16,0:34:08.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个妇产科护士\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the neonatal nurses
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.89,0:34:11.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱走了两个刚刚出世的婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walked right off the unit with two babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.19,0:34:12.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟我开玩笑的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.23,0:34:13.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向天发誓这千真万确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swear to god.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.28,0:34:14.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个工作了17年的老护士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worked there 17 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.63,0:34:17.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然有一天  冷不防地  就抱走了孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then one day, out of the blue, she just does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.74,0:34:25.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这真是太毛骨悚然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just horrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.04,0:34:26.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事后她尽然说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now she's saying
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.11,0:34:28.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全不记得发生了什么事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That she doesn't even remember what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.24,0:34:30.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说自己像是着了魔似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like she was possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.24,0:34:30.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真鬼扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.95,0:34:32.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.66,0:34:34.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁会那么残忍向他们下手啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who could ever lay a finger on them?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.76,0:34:36.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.27,0:34:40.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是那么甜美\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.19,0:34:56.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是说  现在有个嗜美味恶魔护士了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, our demon gourmet nurse...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.02,0:34:58.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}...you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.53,0:35:01.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.22,0:35:03.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明晚就轮到她上夜班了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Graveyard shift. tomorrow night.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.47,0:35:04.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在此期间\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the meantime,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.61,0:35:06.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果想强大到足以对付莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're gonna be strong enough to kill Lilith,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.70,0:35:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该找比我更强大的恶魔才行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna need more than I can give you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.69,0:35:13.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.77,0:35:17.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别那样  没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.67,0:35:18.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我需要更多的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, I need more.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.95,0:35:20.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I get it. I know it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.46,0:35:22.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.63,0:35:26.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是希望他能信任我  知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish he'd trusted me, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.35,0:35:27.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.74,0:35:31.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不过是希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just hope...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.40,0:35:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等这一切结束之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, when all this is over...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.79,0:35:39.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有机会弥补\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope we can fix things.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.30,0:35:46.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警察在麋鹿河外的河渠里发现了爬云梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cops found the escalade in a ditch outside Elk River.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.67,0:35:48.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-距我现在的地方多远  -几小时的路程\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How far away am I? - couple of hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.87,0:35:52.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我查了气象资料  又打了几个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pulled up a weather map, made some calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.71,0:35:55.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,距你那儿不远的  冷泉镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a town not far from there, Coldspring,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.38,0:35:56.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,显然有恶魔出没的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lighting up with demon signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.92,0:35:58.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可是个观光胜地啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good place to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.19,0:36:00.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.02,0:36:02.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  -记住我们找萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - us finding Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.60,0:36:04.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目的是为了让他悬崖勒马\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's got to be about getting him back,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.79,0:36:06.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而不是逼他无路可退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not pushing him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.56,0:36:08.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.01,0:36:10.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你气得爆肝  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're mad, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.34,0:36:10.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我了解那种感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.84,0:36:11.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生气归生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a right to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.90,0:36:14.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但  我不得不说一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}But... I'm just saying --
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.43,0:36:16.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论如何都别硬碰硬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be good to him anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.68,0:36:19.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好和他沟通下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to get through to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.76,0:36:59.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.58,0:37:01.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.91,0:37:03.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.94,0:37:07.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩会来这儿准备干一票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, that must have been some party you two had going,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.91,0:37:10.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却不通知我一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Considering how hard you tried to keep me from crashing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.97,0:37:14.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要找到你们确实很困难  不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, solid try, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.28,0:37:15.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是赶来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.75,0:37:18.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你能来我很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I'm glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.33,0:37:20.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我们先谈谈这儿的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look...let's just talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.57,0:37:23.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等灭了她  我们再慢慢聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon as she's dead, we can talk all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.71,0:37:28.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,露比  快离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby, get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.11,0:37:29.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她哪儿都别想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.77,0:37:35.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她就是始作俑者  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's poison, Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.45,0:37:36.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实并非你想得那样  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not what you think, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.51,0:37:38.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧她对你做得一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what she did to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.50,0:37:41.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她总是每隔数周就会自动现身又再消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she up and vanishes, weeks at a time,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.26,0:37:42.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扔下来痛得死去活来的你跑掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leaves you cracking out for another hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.87,0:37:44.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是在打探莉莉丝的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was looking for Lilith!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.68,0:37:46.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那正是法语里面一个说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is french for
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.53,0:37:48.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓住了软肋自然就能控制你\N{\fnArial\fs30}"manipulating your ass 10 ways from sunday."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.72,0:37:51.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你错了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.51,0:37:54.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  你这是在自欺欺人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you're lying to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.64,0:37:59.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是  为你着想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just... want you to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.27,0:38:01.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换作是我你也会做同样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would do the same for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.71,0:38:03.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.66,0:38:05.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.51,0:38:11.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我把话说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just listen for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.67,0:38:14.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们发现了一个和莉莉丝极相似的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a lead on a demon close to Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.15,0:38:15.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起来吧  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with us, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.77,0:38:18.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起对付这个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll do this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.26,0:38:19.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那听起来好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds great.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.84,0:38:21.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但只能是你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as it's you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.69,0:38:23.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那恶魔贱人就是个老鼠屎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demon bitch is a deal breaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.05,0:38:25.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去和她吻个别  我们立马离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kiss her goodbye, we can go right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.31,0:38:28.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.76,0:38:32.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我需要她  需要她帮我灭了莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I need her -- to help me kill Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.19,0:38:33.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我清楚现在你无法接受这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you can't wrap your head around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.74,0:38:38.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但或许  将来的某一天  你终会理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}But maybe, one day... you'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.56,0:38:41.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是唯一能够阻止天启降世的人  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the only one who can do this, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.97,0:38:48.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你绝不是能够阻止这一切的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not the one who's gonna do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.68,0:38:49.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊  我差点儿就忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. that's right. I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.93,0:38:51.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使认为你才是命定之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels think it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.99,0:38:53.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我办不到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think I can?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.17,0:38:55.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  你办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.01,0:38:57.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你根本就不够强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.15,0:38:58.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你小子说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.18,0:38:59.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是实事求是罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm being practical here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.71,0:39:02.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我已经做好了准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing what needs to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.11,0:39:03.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.17,0:39:05.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会就是指那该死的吸血吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna do a single damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.29,0:39:07.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再对我指手画脚了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop bossing me around, Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.33,0:39:09.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.39,0:39:13.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过去的岁月  我都以你马首是瞻\N{\fnArial\fs30}My whole life, you take the wheel,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.17,0:39:14.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是你说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call the shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.75,0:39:18.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就因为你是我大哥我对你是百分百地信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I trust you because you are my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.29,0:39:21.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此刻  我请求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I am asking you,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.52,0:39:23.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}For once...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.69,0:39:25.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.53,0:39:32.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.40,0:39:33.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你根本不明白自己都在干嘛  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what you're doing, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.79,0:39:34.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我清楚得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.69,0:39:35.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就更糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then that's worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.96,0:39:37.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  听着  所以我才告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? look, I'm telling you --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.97,0:39:39.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这跟你做了什么没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's not something that you're doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.30,0:39:41.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是你究竟算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.21,0:39:45.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.98,0:39:47.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.91,0:39:52.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.50,0:39:59.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.81,0:40:04.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说白了你就是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means you're a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.89,0:41:24.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你根本就不了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.84,0:41:26.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从没了解过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never did.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.09,0:41:31.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更永远无法了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you never will.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.88,0:41:35.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦踏出这个门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You walk out that door...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.07,0:41:40.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就永远也别想回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you ever come back.
